{x_monitors
    {message, repeat=random
        {message
            output={@
You examine the security monitors. They slowly cycle through various camera
feeds, moving up through the floors of the building. When the 80th floor
is displayed you see movement.

There is a glitching mass of tentacles in the middle of what appears to
be a cocktail lounge!

The occupants of that floor don't seem to notice it.

            }
        }
        {message
            output={@
You examine the monitors. They slowly cycle through various camera
feeds. When the 80th floor is displayed you see movement.

There is a glitching mass of tentacles moving through what appears to
be a cocktail lounge!

The occupants of that floor don't seem to notice it.

            }
        }
    }
}











